{
  "generated": "2026-03-25T10:15:03.015022",
  "total_entries": 37,
  "history": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "text": "他更冒进，最终落入红军印社的伏击圈，以退形换起反攻，以暂时的被动换取最终的主动的体现",
      "timestamp": 1774404617.701277,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:10:17",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 0,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "text": "。嗯第二个是第六节中的集中兵力思想，文中阐释了劣势条件下，以少胜多的方法，认为无论怎样呃复杂严重残酷的环境",
      "timestamp": 1774404631.9674199,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:10:31",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "，军事指导者首先需要的是独立自主组织和使用自己的力量",
      "timestamp": 1774404636.5622132,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:10:36",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "，在人民进行天后的条件呢给我们以极大的援助时，利用相对劣势，以游击队或小支队前制其正面的，红军集中全力突击其中另一的一部分",
      "timestamp": 1774404649.0290911,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:10:49",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "，当然也是必要的，并且是可以胜利的",
      "timestamp": 1774404651.927849,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:10:51",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "。当我当我进袭军起义的一部分时，兵力的对比仍适用于优势，对劣势以多胜少的原则",
      "timestamp": 1774404659.606862,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:10:59",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "。在山城堡战役的第二幕中，红军面对的是少马爷这个敌军唯一的退路和阻击援军的关键支点",
      "timestamp": 1774404670.334986,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:11:10",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "text": "。正面强攻尚未巨载，特意一会就能出席功能",
      "timestamp": 1774404673.949279,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:11:13",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "text": "。红军没有被动的选择敌人设好的正面战场，而是主动开辟自己的战场",
      "timestamp": 1774404680.077442,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:11:20",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "text": "，把主力用在敌人意想不到的地方，在局部战场上形成了一个优势",
      "timestamp": 1774404685.716627,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:11:25",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "text": "。呃第三个思想就是呃第九节中的歼灭战思想",
      "timestamp": 1774404693.913999,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:11:33",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "text": "。呃文中提到对于人伤及十指不如断其一指，呃对于敌人击溃其十个师不如歼灭其一个师",
      "timestamp": 1774404701.576703,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:11:41",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "text": "。文中认为中国红军作战的基本方针是歼灭战，只有歼灭敌人的有生力量，才能打破围剿和发展革命根据地",
      "timestamp": 1774404709.773757,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:11:49",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "text": "，应以敌杀伤而呃给我以消耗，又因敌以歼灭而给我以补充，这样就不但抵偿了我军的消耗，而且增加了我军的力量",
      "timestamp": 1774404721.054794,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:12:01",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "。呃在山城堡战役的第三幕中，当红军面临先坚残敌还是先阻援军的抉择时",
      "timestamp": 1774404728.702288,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:12:08",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "text": "，选择了集集中主力优先追歼残敌，因为残敌虽然溃败，但只要不死就有可能重新集结死灰复燃",
      "timestamp": 1774404737.962378,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:12:17",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "。而援军自然逼一进，但只有彻底消灭眼前敌人，红军才能从容应对，防止顾此失彼",
      "timestamp": 1774404744.579807,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:12:24",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "。宣传稿战役最终全歼敌人第七十八师主力，迫使胡宗南部全线后撤，彻底粉碎了蒋介石的围剿计划，对",
      "timestamp": 1774404754.337718,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:12:34",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "。呃以上三点就是我们从山城堡战役中看到了毛泽东的军事思想，呃下面是一些现实的启示",
      "timestamp": 1774404764.5631082,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:12:44",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "。从以导的继续分享中，我们也可以得到一些现实的启示。首先第一是坚持党对军队的绝对领导，在当时我们也看到许多指挥员的意见出现了许多分歧，但正是因为党对军队的绝对领导，最后才形成了一个",
      "timestamp": 1774404784.000937,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:13:04",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "一个统一的意见，在党指挥枪的情况下形成了军事合力，从而夺得了作战的胜利。那么在当下呢我们也需要坚持这一原则，坚持党对人民军队的绝对领导",
      "timestamp": 1774404796.374315,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:13:16",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "，才能",
      "timestamp": 1774404796.864901,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:13:16",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "text": "实现思想建党政治建军，确保方向不偏力量不散",
      "timestamp": 1774404801.488749,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:13:21",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "text": "。第二是要坚持灵活机动的战略战术，把握斗争的主动权",
      "timestamp": 1774404807.102407,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:13:27",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "text": "。在当时的生城堡战役中，面对东北战面对对方的优势和我们的劣势，我们并没有采用正面硬拼的方式，而是灵活机动的选择了四面围歼，那么在当下呢面对各种不一样的风险挑战",
      "timestamp": 1774404821.477737,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:13:41",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "text": "，无论是我们处于优势还是劣势，都要坚持实事求是，因事施策，以战略主动赢得斗争主动",
      "timestamp": 1774404829.135458,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:13:49",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "text": "。第三是要凝聚多元力量，形成斗争合力，筑牢人民战争的基础",
      "timestamp": 1774404835.804756,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:13:55",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "text": "。毛泽东军事思想始终强调人民是战争的主体，我们要团结一切可以团结的力量，建立最广泛的统一战线。在生城堡战役中，我是一方面凝聚内部力量",
      "timestamp": 1774404847.542287,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:14:07",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "text": "，另一方面在外部积极开展统一战线工作，在多方的合力下形成了战役胜利。那么在当下呢要想维护国家安全和发展利益，也希望凝聚全社会全民族乃至国际上的一切正义力量",
      "timestamp": 1774404860.869749,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:14:20",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "text": "，筑牢新时代人民战争的坚实基础",
      "timestamp": 1774404863.956784,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:14:23",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "text": "，这样才能应对各种社会问题",
      "timestamp": 1774404866.498158,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:14:26",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 31,
      "text": "。感谢刚才同学的分享",
      "timestamp": 1774404873.1235032,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:14:33",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 32,
      "text": "。那从山城堡战役呢我们可以",
      "timestamp": 1774404877.261166,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:14:37",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 33,
      "text": "呃",
      "timestamp": 1774404878.276916,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:14:38",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 34,
      "text": "读懂一些毛泽东的军事思想",
      "timestamp": 1774404880.8316958,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:14:40",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 35,
      "text": "，他整个的决策过程呢浓缩了毛泽东军事思想的许多精髓",
      "timestamp": 1774404885.945765,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:14:45",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 36,
      "text": "，诱敌深入的战略退却，歼灭战的战略核心，运动战的灵活机动，人民战争的政治智慧以及实事求是的思想灵魂",
      "timestamp": 1774404895.6480992,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 10:14:55",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
